{"suttaId":"tha-ap292","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8850,8873],"vripara":"43"},"segments":{"tha-ap292:0.3":"Pubbaṅgamiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap292:1.1":"“Cullāsītisahassāni, pabbajimha akiñcanā;","tha-ap292:1.3":"Tesaṃ pubbaṅgamo āsiṃ, uttamatthassa pattiyā.","tha-ap292:2.1":"“Sarāgā sabhavā [samohā (syā.)] cete, vippasannamanāvilā;","tha-ap292:2.3":"Upaṭṭhahiṃsu sakkaccaṃ, pasannā sehi pāṇibhi.","tha-ap292:3.1":"“Khīṇāsavā vantadosā, katakiccā anāsavā;","tha-ap292:3.3":"Phariṃsu mettacittena, sayambhū aparājitā.","tha-ap292:4.1":"“Tesaṃ upaṭṭhahitvāna, sambuddhānaṃ patissato;","tha-ap292:4.3":"Maraṇañca anuppatto, devattañca agamhase.","tha-ap292:5.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ sīlamanupālayiṃ;","tha-ap292:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, saññamassa idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap292:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap292:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pubbaṅgamiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap292:8.1":"Pubbaṅgamiyattherassāpadānaṃ dasamaṃ.","tha-ap292:9.1":"Paṇṇadāyakavaggo ekūnatiṃsatimo.","tha-ap292:10.1":"Tassuddānaṃ –","tha-ap292:11.1":"Paṇṇaṃ phalaṃ paccuggamaṃ, ekapupphi ca maghavā;","tha-ap292:11.3":"Upaṭṭhākāpadānañca, pabbajjā buddhupaṭṭhāko;","tha-ap292:11.5":"Pubbaṅgamo ca gāthāyo, aṭṭhatālīsa kittitā."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
